{
  "uid": "items-api",
  "title": "Items API Health",
  "tags": [
    "items-api",
    "autoscale-platform"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Availability (targets up)",
      "description": "Share of items-api pods answering Prometheus scrapes. Source: Prometheus `up` metric.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "avg(up{job=\"items-api\"}) * 100",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 99
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 100
              }
            ]
          },
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Request rate",
      "description": "User requests/s, 5m average, excluding probes and scrapes. Source: app counter http_requests_total.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 4,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "job:http_requests:rate5m",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Error rate (5xx)",
      "description": "5xx share of user requests, 5m. Alert fires above 5% for 2m. Source: app counter.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(job:http_errors:rate5m or job:http_requests:rate5m * 0) / (job:http_requests:rate5m > 0)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.05
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "p95 latency",
      "description": "95th percentile request duration, 5m. Alert fires above 500 ms for 5m. Source: app histogram.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "job:http_request_duration_seconds:p95_5m",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.25
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Replicas (available)",
      "description": "Pods passing readiness. Source: kube-state-metrics.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "kube_deployment_status_replicas_available{namespace=\"autoscale-app\", deployment=\"items-api\"}",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Requests in range",
      "description": "Total user requests in the selected time range. Source: app counter.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 20,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(http_requests_total{job=\"items-api\", path!~\"/health|/ready|/metrics\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request rate by status",
      "description": "User requests/s split by HTTP status (1m window). Source: app counter.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(http_requests_total{job=\"items-api\", path!~\"/health|/ready|/metrics\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requests by route",
      "description": "Route templates, not raw URLs, keep cardinality bounded. Source: app counter.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (method, path) (rate(http_requests_total{job=\"items-api\", path!~\"/health|/ready|/metrics\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{method}} {{path}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latency percentiles",
      "description": "Percentiles are estimated from histogram buckets (5ms..5s), so values are bucket-interpolated, not exact. Source: app histogram.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"items-api\", path!~\"/health|/ready|/metrics\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"items-api\", path!~\"/health|/ready|/metrics\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"items-api\", path!~\"/health|/ready|/metrics\"}[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "In-flight requests",
      "description": "Requests being processed right now, per pod. Source: app gauge.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (pod) (http_requests_in_progress{job=\"items-api\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Pod CPU vs request",
      "description": "CPU cores per pod. Sources: kubelet/cAdvisor (usage), kube-state-metrics (request, limit).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (pod) (rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace=\"autoscale-app\", container=\"api\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(kube_pod_container_resource_requests{namespace=\"autoscale-app\", container=\"api\", resource=\"cpu\"})",
          "legendFormat": "request (HPA 100% = this)",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(kube_pod_container_resource_limits{namespace=\"autoscale-app\", container=\"api\", resource=\"cpu\"})",
          "legendFormat": "limit (throttled above)",
          "refId": "C"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "cores",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Pod memory vs limit",
      "description": "Working-set memory per pod. Sources: kubelet/cAdvisor (usage), kube-state-metrics (limit).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 20,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (pod) (container_memory_working_set_bytes{namespace=\"autoscale-app\", container=\"api\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{pod}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max(kube_pod_container_resource_limits{namespace=\"autoscale-app\", container=\"api\", resource=\"memory\"})",
          "legendFormat": "limit (OOM-killed above)",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Autoscaling: replicas",
      "description": "HPA and Deployment replica counts. Source: kube-state-metrics.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 28,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "kube_horizontalpodautoscaler_status_current_replicas{namespace=\"autoscale-app\", horizontalpodautoscaler=\"items-api\"}",
          "legendFormat": "current",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "kube_horizontalpodautoscaler_status_desired_replicas{namespace=\"autoscale-app\", horizontalpodautoscaler=\"items-api\"}",
          "legendFormat": "desired",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "kube_horizontalpodautoscaler_spec_max_replicas{namespace=\"autoscale-app\", horizontalpodautoscaler=\"items-api\"}",
          "legendFormat": "max",
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "kube_deployment_status_replicas_available{namespace=\"autoscale-app\", deployment=\"items-api\"}",
          "legendFormat": "available",
          "refId": "D"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "lineInterpolation": "stepAfter"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Where these metrics come from",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 28,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**App instrumentation** (`/metrics`, prometheus_client)\n- `http_requests_total` - counter by method, route, status\n- `http_request_duration_seconds` - histogram\n- `http_requests_in_progress` - gauge\n\n**Prometheus itself**\n- `up` - did the scrape succeed\n\n**Kubernetes / infrastructure**\n- kubelet/cAdvisor - `container_cpu_usage_seconds_total`, `container_memory_working_set_bytes`\n- kube-state-metrics - replicas, HPA status, resource requests/limits\n\nProbe and scrape paths (`/health`, `/ready`, `/metrics`) are excluded from user-traffic panels."
      }
    }
  ],
  "description": "Health of the Items API on the local kind cluster. Every panel uses a metric that exists; see the source note in each panel's description."
}
